    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>*没看过视频的小伙伴，可以来B站找我玩，搜索【</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/520819684" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/520819684"><span>小Lin说</span></a><span>】~</span></p><span></span><p><span>熟悉我们的朋友知道，大概两年半之前我们就和Luis聊过，主要聊了聊他是怎么从零到一做起来的，当时大家的反馈非常好。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在AI冲击下，多邻国的月活数量反而持续上涨，市值一年之内翻了三倍，这是怎么回事儿？而最近的半年多邻国的股价又是一路跌跌撞撞，这又是为什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们还聊了关于:</span></p><span></span><p><span>●他对多邻国的商业思考</span></p><span></span><p><span>●AI对教育、对社会的冲击</span></p><span></span><p><span>●他自己的成长和人生</span></p><span></span><p><span>等等...很多对话我真的是舍不得删，所以这段视频可能会有点长，我相信大家听完会有不少收获的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【章节】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">2:20</a> Luis是谁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">2:21</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="336">5:36</a> 向华尔街低头？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="337">5:37</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">10:43</a> &nbsp;多邻国的"代言人"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="644">10:44</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> CEO的成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="981">16:21</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1191">19:51</a> &nbsp;公司文化 - 5个原则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1192">19:52</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1357">22:37</a> 能学会么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1358">22:38</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1656">27:36</a> AI的冲击</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1657">27:37</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">30:31</a> &nbsp;教育的未来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1832">30:32</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2151">35:51</a>多邻国成功的关键</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2152">35:52</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2382">39:42</a> 中国市场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2383">39:43</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2751">45:51</a> 凭什么成功的是你？</span></p>]]></description>
